  "editorial_notes": "Source footage was exposed with a flat/log-like profile to preserve highlight detail in the outdoor windows. This grade restores a natural contrast curve and adds a slight warm-to-cool split: warm highlights (gain.r elevated, gain.b reduced) against slightly cool shadows (lift.b elevated). The hue_vs_sat curve boosts skin-tone saturation modestly (+0.05 in the orange hue band) and desaturates cyans (-0.08) to prevent the sky from competing with the subject. Lum_vs_sat reduces saturation in the very darkest and very brightest areas to keep the image clean at extremes. Temperature set to 5200K to correct the mixed indoor/window light source; slight negative tint corrects for the green cast from fluorescent practicals.",
